<h2 id="sec-1">Quick Comparison</h2>
<p>The robot vacuum market has exploded, and finding quality models under $300 requires careful evaluation. We tested 20 robot vacuums in real home environments over three months, measuring suction power, navigation accuracy, battery life, and app functionality.</p>
