<div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1A1A1A 0%,#2A2A2A 100%);color:white;padding:2rem;border-radius:12px;margin-top:2rem"><p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 0.75rem 0;color:#C9A962">Our Recommendation</p><p style="margin:0;line-height:1.8">The <strong>Roborock Qrevo</strong> at $279 is the clear winner under $300. For budget buyers, the <strong>Eufy RoboVac X8</strong> at $249 delivers 90% of the performance. Pet owners should consider the <strong>Shark IQ Robot</strong>.</p></div>
